### Create Product (POST Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "iPhone 15",
  "description": "Apple flagship smartphone",
  "price": 79999,
  "stock": 10,
  "category": "Electronics"
}

###

### Fetch All Products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products

###

### Fetch Single Product
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/1

###

### Full Update Product (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "iPhone 15 Pro",
  "description": "Updated Apple flagship smartphone",
  "price": 89999,
  "stock": 8,
  "category": "Electronics"
}

###

### Partial Update Product (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 74999,
  "stock": 5
}

###

### Delete Product
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/1
Content-Type: application/json